{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":357821,\"title\":\"Cinderella: Frozen in Time\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"What happened to Cinderella, really?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f9RKak5tXRpGfMUHPKCMVzKpFDs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1994,\"runtime\":60,\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Sterling Johnson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2337336,\"name\":\"Sterling Johnson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":218447,\"name\":\"Dorothy Hamill\",\"character\":\"Cinderella\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t2YH4asocY2ynfJXQsflGGHd5KO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2177,\"name\":\"Lloyd Bridges\",\"character\":\"The Storyteller\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lO4HWxYvneC0dMFckK2WrKPZa9o.jpg\"},{\"id\":5723202,\"name\":\"F. Scott Driscoll\",\"character\":\"Buttons\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5723203,\"name\":\"Catherine Foulkes\",\"character\":\"Fairy Godmother\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1736982,\"name\":\"Andrew Naylor\",\"character\":\"Prince Charming\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1493400,\"title\":\"Camp Rock 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rS7byWK9cfPfdLeFNlRIaJxH9mN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vJb3fniB8E0JnSMr1tDyIsb6gPi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When pop group Connect 3 returns to Camp Rock to search for an opening act for their reunion tour, rising tensions and fierce competition among campers test old friendships and spark unexpected romances.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10947,\"title\":\"High School Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2p1nyBVSEBiCTrrZeVSV9nIsqHr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High's social order.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1548113,\"title\":\"The Muppet Show\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tcwar1rL0neoLvnklL7DzYw7sN8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qz7B5uDspnkoz068wLbLnleotwV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Music, comedy, and a whole lot of chaos is bound to ensue when The Muppets once again take the stage of the original Muppet Theatre with their very special guest, Sabrina Carpenter!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":35558,\"title\":\"Starstruck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kuyJuNiiZvu5iNr8Dgv5y75v1uc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nsWgxQrDcTVhSGzAu5kVlw64XB1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pop star Christopher Wilde has fame, fortune and a big-budget Hollywood movie awaiting him. But after meeting Jessica Olson, a down-to-earth girl from the Midwest, he is faced with following his heart or doing what's best for his career.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299513,\"title\":\"Drumline: A New Beat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bK4bMXT4xQoJRytBqSQS3FJmFBS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3m1OyEg7X2nRbY76VeV4j25bh1m.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A girl from New York attends a college in Atlanta to join their once-famous marching band.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":65218,\"title\":\"Lemonade Mouth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBy0tIjlc3rAy4dih74RFDIpxoP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When five ragtag freshman first meet in detention, it seems they have nothing in common. But, through music, they form an unbreakable bond and discover they have the makings of the greatest high school garage band in history! In the face of incredible odds, Olivia, Stella, Wen, Mohini and Charlie find they can make a real difference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":177888,\"title\":\"Teen Beach Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sKrGe5EmDSyVaWM0uj7rJDQHRjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKoJTTgpyWiu04hzSgPWbyJfjYi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life's a beach for surfers Brady and McKenzie – until a rogue wave magically transports them inside the classic '60s beach party flick, \\\"Wet Side Story,\\\" where a full-blown rivalry between bikers and surfers threatens to erupt. There, amidst a sea of surfing, singing and dancing, Brady and Mack accidentally change the storyline, and the film’s dreamy hero and heroine fall for them instead of for each other!\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":89185,\"title\":\"Radio Rebel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wycDdx2BrdNKlyTZoZT8uLeu6dq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuhKYERTbwHmQPoqhl2AuzP2XPM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"High school senior Tara is so painfully shy that she dreads speaking to anyone in the hallways or getting called on in class. But in the privacy of her bedroom with her iPod in hand, she rocks out -- doing mock broadcasts for Miami's hottest FM radio station, which happens to be owned by her stepfather. When a slot opens up at The SLAM, Tara surprises herself by blossoming behind the mike into confident, \\\"Radio Rebel\\\" -- and to everyone's shock, she's a hit!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":32293,\"title\":\"The Cheetah Girls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7XOJqR8WErIm1ZqytABCEuUke1C.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJVUx5xUes9cTDpMiNWx4Fab2ac.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A four-member teen girl group named the Cheetah Girls go to a Manhattan High School for the Performing Arts and try to become the first freshmen to win the talent show in the school's history. During the talent show auditions, they meet a big-time producer named Jackal Johnson, who tries to make the group into superstars, but the girls run into many problems.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"7P9MAw4olkQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"yFmcvbbCOuQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3o8eywPoZRc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":